      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## showLabel\n\nWhether the node draws its label.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | node, applies to any |\n| Written at | `node.showLabel` |\n| Type | boolean |\n| Default | true |\n| Valid | true, false |\n| Applies | edit, browse |\n| Properties panel | none found |\n| Written down | no |\n| Status | built |"
        },
        "identity": {
