          "name": "rotation",
          "scope": "node",
          "writePath": "node.data.rotation",
          "valueType": "number",
          "unit": "degrees, clockwise",
          "default": 0,
          "effect": "Turns the node. Its handles and the edges that end on it turn with it.",
          "modes": [
            "edit",
            "browse"
          ],
          "panel": "none found",
          "writtenDown": "docs, in part",
          "status": "built",
          "appliesTo": [
            "any"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "authoring-switches-switch-semantic-zoom-resolution",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "semanticZoom.resolution",
      "position": {
        "x": 640,
        "y": 2760
      },
      "width": 600,
      "height": 640,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## semanticZoom.resolution\n\nWhere along the zoom a view takes over: 1 is the conventional detail, lower is smaller, and 3 opens the whole graph. Fractional values allow any number of views.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | node, applies to face |\n| Written at | `node.data.semanticZoom.resolution` |\n| Type | number |\n| Default | 1 |\n| Valid | 0 to 2.99 |\n| Applies | browse |\n| Properties panel | yes (\"Resolution\") |\n| Written down | the panel's helper text only |\n| Status | built |\n| Governed by | policy-which-view |"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "authoring-switches"
        },
        "switch": {
          "id": "semantic-zoom-resolution",
          "name": "semanticZoom.resolution",
          "scope": "node",
          "writePath": "node.data.semanticZoom.resolution",
          "valueType": "number",
          "default": 1,
          "range": [
            0,
            2.99
          ],
          "effect": "Where along the zoom a view takes over: 1 is the conventional detail, lower is smaller, and 3 opens the whole graph. Fractional values allow any number of views.",
          "modes": [
            "browse"
          ],
          "panel": "yes (\"Resolution\")",
          "writtenDown": "the panel's helper text only",
          "status": "built",
          "governedBy": "policy-which-view",
          "appliesTo": [
            "face"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "authoring-switches-switch-semantic-level",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "semanticLevel",
      "position": {
        "x": 1280,
        "y": 2760
      },
      "width": 600,
      "height": 640,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## semanticLevel\n\nNames the representation a face is. Which one shows at a size is a policy.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | node, applies to face |\n| Written at | `node.data.semanticLevel` (also read at `node.data.view.semanticLevel`) |\n| Type | enum |\n| Default | detail |\n| Valid | badge, icon, summary, detail; also read: glyph as badge, dot as badge, card as summary |\n| Applies | browse |\n| Properties panel | no |\n| Written down | no |\n| Status | built |\n| Governed by | policy-which-view |"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "authoring-switches"
        },
        "switch": {
          "id": "semantic-level",
          "name": "semanticLevel",
          "scope": "node",
          "writePath": "node.data.semanticLevel",
          "alsoRead": "node.data.view.semanticLevel",
          "valueType": "enum",
          "default": "detail",
          "enum": [
            "badge",
            "icon",
            "summary",
            "detail"
          ],
          "aliases": {
            "glyph": "badge",
            "dot": "badge",
            "card": "summary"
          },
          "effect": "Names the representation a face is. Which one shows at a size is a policy.",
          "modes": [
            "browse"
          ],
          "panel": "no",
          "writtenDown": "no",
          "status": "built",
          "governedBy": "policy-which-view",
          "appliesTo": [
            "face"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "authoring-switches-switch-handle-presentation",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "handlePresentation",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3440
      },
      "width": 600,
      "height": 640,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## handlePresentation\n\nThe art the port wears: a small graph whose view holds SVG, HTML or canvas, drawn whole with its centre on the border. Changes how the port looks, never how it behaves.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | handle, applies to port, any |\n| Written at | `node.data.handlePresentation` |\n| Type | reference |\n| Default | none |\n| Valid | \"address\", or { sourceRef, sourceNodeId, sourcePayload } |\n| Applies | edit, browse |\n| Properties panel | no |\n| Written down | AGENTS.md |\n| Status | built |"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "authoring-switches"
        },
        "switch": {
          "id": "handle-presentation",
          "name": "handlePresentation",
          "scope": "handle",
          "writePath": "node.data.handlePresentation",
          "valueType": "reference",
          "default": null,
          "shape": "\"address\", or { sourceRef, sourceNodeId, sourcePayload }",
          "effect": "The art the port wears: a small graph whose view holds SVG, HTML or canvas, drawn whole with its centre on the border. Changes how the port looks, never how it behaves.",
          "modes": [
            "edit",
            "browse"
          ],
          "panel": "no",
          "writtenDown": "AGENTS.md",
          "status": "built",
          "appliesTo": [
            "port",
            "any"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
