          "value": "## view.fit\n\nwindow draws the environment at the graph's window and moves it with the camera, as in a poster; screen fills the screen.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | graph, applies to environment-face |\n| Written at | `node.data.view.fit` |\n| Type | enum |\n| Default | screen |\n| Valid | screen, window |\n| Applies | browse |\n| Properties panel | no |\n| Written down | AGENTS.md |\n| Status | built |"
