      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## renderShape\n\nThe format a view's content is rendered as. Unset, the runtime infers it. A companion, renderShape.sourcePath, names the path the content is read from.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | node, applies to face |\n| Written at | `node.data.renderShape.kind` (also read at `node.data.view.renderShape.kind`) |\n| Type | enum |\n| Default | none |\n| Valid | markdown, html, svg, text, image, canvas |\n| Applies | browse |\n| Properties panel | yes (\"Content Format\") |\n| Written down | AGENTS.md says not to add renderShape hints to new graphs |\n| Status | built, discouraged |"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "authoring-switches"
        },
        "switch": {
          "id": "render-shape",
          "name": "renderShape",
          "scope": "node",
          "writePath": "node.data.renderShape.kind",
          "alsoRead": "node.data.view.renderShape.kind",
          "valueType": "enum",
          "default": null,
          "enum": [
            "markdown",
            "html",
            "svg",
            "text",
            "image",
            "canvas"
          ],
          "effect": "The format a view's content is rendered as. Unset, the runtime infers it. A companion, renderShape.sourcePath, names the path the content is read from.",
          "modes": [
            "browse"
          ],
          "panel": "yes (\"Content Format\")",
          "writtenDown": "AGENTS.md says not to add renderShape hints to new graphs",
          "status": "built, discouraged",
          "appliesTo": [
            "face"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
