    {
      "id": "authoring-switches-questions",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Questions",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10920
      },
      "width": 900,
      "height": 380,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Questions\n\n- **showInBrowse** is on one primitive page first; the others follow when that page reads well.\n- Is the data on each card enough for the Properties panel to build a control from it? If not, what is missing?\n- Is **data.switch** a reference that agents read, or a schema the app reads and validates? The first costs nothing; the second means a validator and a version.\n- Where does the finished list live in the library?"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "authoring-switches"
        }
      }
    }
